  "originalQuery": "As a Database Engineer, you are asked to recommend a database solution for a company that plans to store a large volume of heterogeneous user-generated data, such as comments, images, and videos. Which database type should you recommend based on the business requirements?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Cloud Bigtable, a managed NoSQL database service for large analytical and operational workloads.<br/>B. Firestore, a scalable and fully managed NoSQL document database for mobile, web, and server applications.<br/>C. Cloud Spanner, a fully managed, scalable, and consistent relational database service.<br/>D. Cloud SQL, a fully managed relational database service for MySQL, PostgreSQL, and SQL Server.",
